sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client
  participant API as Auth API
  participant RL as Rate Limit
  participant Redis as Redis Bitmap And Cache
  participant OTP as Redis OTP State
  participant Mongo as MongoDB
  participant Mail as Mail Queue

  Client->>API: POST /auth/register
  API->>RL: Apply auth rate limit
  API->>API: Validate input and canonicalize email
  API->>OTP: Check pending registration state
  API->>Redis: GET bitmap:users:email:v1:ready

  alt Bitmap not ready
    Note over API,Redis: Cannot trust BIT = 0, use MongoDB pre-check
    API->>Mongo: Find user by canonical email
    alt User exists
      API-->>Client: 409 Email already exists
    else User missing
      API->>OTP: Store pending registration and OTP
      API->>Mail: Send registration OTP
      API-->>Client: OTP sent
    end
  else Bitmap ready
    API->>Redis: GETBIT bitmap:users:email:v1 at email index
  end

  alt Ready and BIT = 0
    Note over API,Redis: Definitely absent only if bitmap is complete
    API->>OTP: Store pending registration and OTP
    API->>Mail: Send registration OTP
    API-->>Client: OTP sent
  else Ready and BIT = 1
    Note over API,Redis: Maybe exists, never proof of existence
    API->>Redis: GET user:email:{sha256(email)}
    alt Positive cache hit
      API-->>Client: 409 Email already exists
    else Positive cache miss
      API->>Mongo: Find user by canonical email
      alt User exists
        API->>Redis: SET user:email:{sha256(email)}
        API-->>Client: 409 Email already exists
      else User missing
        API->>OTP: Store pending registration and OTP
        API->>Mail: Send registration OTP
        API-->>Client: OTP sent
      end
    end
  end

  Client->>API: POST /auth/register/verify-otp
  API->>RL: Apply auth rate limit
  API->>OTP: Verify OTP and load pending registration
  OTP-->>API: Pending canonical email
  API->>Mongo: Create user under unique email index

  alt Create succeeds
    API->>Redis: SET user:email:{hash}
    API->>Redis: SETBIT bitmap:users:email:v1
    API->>Redis: DEL nf:email:{hash}
    API->>OTP: Delete registration OTP state
    API-->>Client: Account verified
  else Duplicate key race
    API->>OTP: Delete stale registration OTP state
    API-->>Client: 409 Email already exists
  end
